   "title": "Two Hands, Two Tools",
   "turnin": "r14_human_elder",
   "xp": 30
  },
  {
   "copper": 6,
   "description": "The day's work ends, and the gnawing begins: Large Rats come out after sunset in the Dawnmere Meadows, which lie in the heart of Dawnmere Fields. Kill eight there at night. Leave space between your fights; one squeal can summon a family reunion you do not want to attend.",
   "giver": "r14_human_elder",
   "giver_name": "Elian Reed",
   "giver_settlement": "Dawnmere",
