   "xp": 100
  },
  {
   "copper": 4,
   "description": "Every loose hinge in Dawnmere seems to find its way onto my list. Smelt three Copper Bars and three Tin Bars from the local ore, then bring them to me for the town repairs. I will give you a Dual Furnace for your own work; set it outside protected ground, where it will not become my next complaint.",
