   "xp": 110
  },
  {
   "copper": 5,
   "description": "The fishermen came back from the Dawnmere Wreck Coast west from here with empty nets and some very firm opinions about Monstrous Crabs. Kill five there by day so our folk can try their luck again. Go while the sun is up; the drowned dead walk that shore after dark, and I would rather you came home for supper.",
