   "xp": 163
  },
  {
   "copper": 4,
   "description": "I have a flour shelf to dust and a supper to rescue. Bring me two Crab Legs from the Monstrous Crabs on the Dawnmere Wreck Coast west from here, and one Fox Tail from the Young Foxes in the Dawnmere Pastures; hunt both by day. Legs for the pot, tail for the shelf, and keep the Crab Eyes for yourself. I have enough people watching me cook.",
